name: ['Accumulated Knowledge', 'Avalanche Riders', 'Brainstorm', 'Carrion Feeder', 'Krosan Warchief', 'Lightning Rift', 'Mother of Runes', 'Reanimate', 'Silver Knight', 'Slice and Dice', 'Treetop Village', 'Willbender']
